# REMOVED — static zone files are not used with PowerDNS Authoritative.
#
# Zone data lives in the PostgreSQL database on the hidden master and is
# provisioned via the PowerDNS HTTP API:
#
#   radiodns/dns/scripts/provision-zone.sh
#
# Secondaries (ns1-ns11) receive zone data via TSIG-authenticated AXFR/IXFR.
